# States the sorter covers. One list drives both the zip table
# (tools/build_zip_table.py) and the road map (tools/osrm_setup.sh), so a
# team zip in any listed state gets coordinates and drive times.
# Comma-separated USPS codes. Changing it means rerunning setup.sh, then
# tools/enable_drive_times.sh if you use drive times.
STATES=WA,OR
